  eventID: PlayerStandingStillThree
  dialogueLines:
  - "The player still hasn\u2019t moved. Soon, the narrator may have to do something
    about this."
  - The player remains completely still. The narrator is starting to think intervention
    may be necessary.
  - Still no movement. The narrator is becoming genuinely concerned now.
  - "The player hasn\u2019t moved for far too long. The narrator may need to step
    in."
  - "The player is still standing there. The narrator is beginning to run out of
    patience\u2014and options."
  - Not a single movement. The narrator is starting to think something needs to be
    done.
  - The player remains frozen in place. The narrator is seriously considering intervening.
  - The player still refuses to move. The narrator is becoming rather concerned about
    this.
  - There has been no movement for quite some time. The narrator may have to take
    matters into their own hands.
  - The player is still completely motionless. The narrator is giving them a little
    longer, but not much.
